<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101917" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοιν-ίς</span></b>  (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Α</span>), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῖδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σχοινίον</span>
			, <i>rope, cord</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				23.51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wall-decoration</i> in form of a rope, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Supp.Epigr.</u>
				4.453.17
			</span></i> (Didyma, <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); similar decoration of a
			silver cup, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				214.55
			</span></i> (ibid., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σχοινῄς</span>
			 (q.v.), <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				832
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
